{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Most Absurd Apocalyptic Hack-and-Slash Adventure!Zombies Hate to Die thrusts you into a darkly humorous apocalyptic wasteland, wielding outrageous weapons for physics-driven hack-and-slash thrills, sending zombies flying in a combat frenzy! This isn\u2019t a typical survival game but a roguelike adventure focused on exhilarating action and strategic gear choices. Fight from one outpost to the next, scavenging fuel and food while planning your escape. Limited equipment slots demand clever weapon-item combos to ignite combat, while inventory management adds strategic tension. Snarky tombstones and humorous events make every battle a riot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/6fdacb39fde37d7c0f589530ef8dc69b.poster.avif?t=1769270322\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/6fdacb39fde37d7c0f589530ef8dc69b.webm?t=1769270322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/6fdacb39fde37d7c0f589530ef8dc69b.mp4?t=1769270322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic Gear Combos<br>Limited equipment slots make weapon and item pairings central to hack-and-slash success, creating diverse Builds for varied combat styles. Manage fuel and food in your inventory to add strategic depth to exploration, testing your planning and combat smarts.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/a0720aa6c5047b9b67279cf8ac822325.poster.avif?t=1769270322\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/a0720aa6c5047b9b67279cf8ac822325.webm?t=1769270322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/a0720aa6c5047b9b67279cf8ac822325.mp4?t=1769270322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Violent Aesthetics<br>A physics-driven combat system delivers thrilling hack-and-slash chaos! Unique weapon feedback makes every zombie knockback exhilarating, while quirky items create unexpected kill effects, fueling battle excitement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/a7bd06f5c9d84f3b33f06d8731ed3b63.poster.avif?t=1769270322\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/a7bd06f5c9d84f3b33f06d8731ed3b63.webm?t=1769270322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/a7bd06f5c9d84f3b33f06d8731ed3b63.mp4?t=1769270322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic World<br>Explore procedurally generated maps, navigating abandoned gas stations, supermarkets, hospitals, factories, and perilous demon districts. With multiple path choices, manage vehicle fuel and inventory supplies to plan optimal routes, making every run strategic and suspenseful.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/d9114d7216e91e6e4ada57b1f44fb5b9.poster.avif?t=1769270322\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/d9114d7216e91e6e4ada57b1f44fb5b9.webm?t=1769270322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/d9114d7216e91e6e4ada57b1f44fb5b9.mp4?t=1769270322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Events<br>Randomly triggered ghostly events bring surprises with challenges and treasures, adding thrilling unpredictability to your adventure.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/38936b534c5c9beebb2f48a4303ce25d.poster.avif?t=1769270322\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/38936b534c5c9beebb2f48a4303ce25d.webm?t=1769270322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/38936b534c5c9beebb2f48a4303ce25d.mp4?t=1769270322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Humor<br>The apocalypse can be hilarious! Snarky tombstones mocking your failures and random humorous events lighten combat intensity, infusing every run with playful fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/9faf4a5e8769dc543c869bde15acb558.poster.avif?t=1769270322\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/9faf4a5e8769dc543c869bde15acb558.webm?t=1769270322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/9faf4a5e8769dc543c869bde15acb558.mp4?t=1769270322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/4b56f837f6271070a19530264a86bf19.poster.avif?t=1769270322\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/4b56f837f6271070a19530264a86bf19.webm?t=1769270322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/4b56f837f6271070a19530264a86bf19.mp4?t=1769270322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why Choose Zombies Hate to Die?<br>This is a battle of wits and brawn against zombies! Physics-animation blending creates smooth, satisfying combat, while strategic gear choices and roguelike progression keep every run fresh. Snarky tombstones immortalize your \u201cepic\u201d feats, adding a playful twist to the apocalypse. Whether you\u2019re an action game fan or a strategy enthusiast, this game will keep you hooked!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cWe\u2019re not just slashing zombies\u2014we\u2019re making them regret crawling out of their graves!\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the apocalyptic party, outsmart and outbash the undead, and craft their ultimate nightmare!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3970080?t=1769270322","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3970080?t=1769270322","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/99c1b8f9578abe557685af9a53fd015ed2e5dbbe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769270322","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/99c1b8f9578abe557685af9a53fd015ed2e5dbbe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769270322","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sh